  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_wildmn",
      "name": {
        "en": "Wild Mane's Badge",
        "zh": "野鬃证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Wild Mane has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude in preemptive penetration of the battlefield situation so as to secure leeway for deployment.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Vanguard Operator during field operations to exercise Charger responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员野鬃擅长抢先切入战局争取部署空间\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为先锋干员，行使冲锋手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_wildmn",
      "name": {
        "en": "Spear Replacement Suit",
        "zh": "长枪替补套装",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_wildmn",
      "description": {
        "en": "Iwona Krukowska's greatest regret is that she was unable to take the wine chalice in her room with her when she left Kazimierz.\nThat goblet forged of gold was a coming-of-age present. No child at that point in the Krukowska family was as gallant as her, and she became the knight they placed their hopes in.\nIwona was used to long-term life in the camp. Scarce on modern means of entertainment, she upheld the strictest work-rest cycle and physical training, all of it for one purpose, becoming a campaign knight—the bravest campaign knight of them all.\nTo the Krukowska family, attaining service as a campaign knight is the highest honor of them all. The ancient family defends at the borderlands, their backs to the prosperous clamor of Kazimierz's cities, facing the frostbitten winters of Ursus. Iwona grew up on stories of heroism, and grew a pure fear and longing for that dangerous, tumultuous battlefield like nothing else.\nThe day her family Knight Primus granted her the chalice, it ensured Iwona had no second thoughts. She beat pure hot blood with every pulse. She signed up to every arduous training regimen with no care for the risk, and improved herself through it. She never took notice of whatever grimy deals and nonsense slander laid behind those majestic ideals. She...\nShe ran too fast, forgot precautions were always called for in perilous circumstances, and just one negligent second would be all it took to brew a tremendous tragedy.\nIwona only forgot this one thing. Just one time.\nShe was mercilessly thrown to the ground in the open country. A lone person hurrying, a lone person wounded, a lone person helpless. Those wild beasts growing Originium crystals wailed at her in their death throes, piercing her eardrums. Those sharp Originium crystals, sent every way by the explosion, skewered a body that wouldn't move as she asked.\nMaking it on willpower until aid came running, Iwona was lucky to survive. But after that, she was thoroughly cut away from the life she used to live.\nThat chalice was placed in her display cabinet, separated by a glass door, and every time Iwona came home, she would wipe it clean.\nShe tried returning to her family afterwards, to at least see her own mother and father again one more time, go back into her room, take away some memories of hers—\nNot once more has she set foot through that heavy wooden door.",
        "zh": "艾沃娜·克鲁科夫斯卡最遗憾的事情之一，便是在离开卡西米尔前未能带走放在她房间中的酒杯。\n那由金子打造而成的酒杯，是她的成年纪念礼物。在那时候，克鲁科夫斯卡家族中没有哪个孩子同她这般英勇，她成了家中最受期待的骑士。\n艾沃娜习惯了长期在营地中的生活。没有太多现代的娱乐手段，保持着最严格的生活作息和体能训练，一切都是为了一个目标，成为征战骑士——最勇敢的征战骑士。\n对克鲁科夫斯卡家族来说，作为征战骑士建功立业，这是一种至高无上的荣耀。古老的家族驻守边疆，他们背朝繁荣喧嚣的卡西米尔城市，面对的是乌萨斯凛冽的寒冬。艾沃娜听着英雄故事长大，无比单纯地对那片危险、混沌的战场产生恐惧与向往。\n从家族长骑将这只酒杯赠予艾沃娜的那一天起，艾沃娜便更没有第二种念想。她纯粹、满腔热血。她不顾危险地报名参加每一种艰难训练，并从中提升自己。她从不理会那些崇高理想背后有什么污秽的交易和闲言碎语。她……\n她跑得太快，忘记了在危机四伏的境地，无论何时都要保持戒备，只要哪怕一秒疏忽，都会酿成巨大的悲剧。\n艾沃娜只是忘记了这一件事。就这一次。\n她被狠狠甩落在原野上。一个人的奔行，一个人的受创，一个人的无助。那些长着源石结晶的野生猛兽在她身旁临死前的啼哭穿透她的耳膜。那因为爆炸而四散的锋利的源石结晶，刺入她无法动弹的身躯。\n靠意志撑到救援人员赶到，艾沃娜有幸活了下来。但那之后，她与自己过去的生活完完全全隔绝开来。\n那只酒杯就放在收藏柜中，被玻璃门隔开，每次艾沃娜回家时都会擦拭一新。\n艾沃娜后来尝试过返回家族，至少再见自己父母一面，再回到自己的房间，带走一些属于自己的回忆——\n她再没有踏进那扇沉重的木门。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
